{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"47428b1b395aeb9d\" href=\"?note=47428b1b395aeb9d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S(T)\n\\land\\neg\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S(T)\n\\land\\neg\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The second conjunct says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> has no infinite branch, so this is a recursive code for a well-founded tree.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47428b1b395aeb9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47428b1b395aeb9d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\